WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:07.440
Can he safely walk and exercise for a couple&nbsp;
of hours? One way of testing whether a surface&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.860
is going to be too hot for your dog to&nbsp;
walk on is using the seven second rule,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:14.940
so you can put the back of your hand on&nbsp;
the surface if you can't keep it there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.480
comfortably for seven seconds it's going&nbsp;
to be too hot for your dog to walk on there

